With fully secured bio-metric based authentication, the simple and intuitive app offers you peace of mind for your everyday banking activity. It is designed to offer a multitude of functions, from balance inquiry, bill payments to quick transactions. 

Using the BNF Mobile App you can: 
•	keep an eye out and take control of your finances;
•	swiftly view account balances and transactions;
•	transfer money securely between own accounts;
•	make quick payments, pay utility bills and much more;
•	send a secure message to our Customer Care team; and
•	log on a unique security device with your fingerprint or password ID.
Simple and Secure, more control for you!

Let's experience the new era of banking together. 

Country borders are slowly disappearing, so why shall you be limited to your local bank? For your beloved ones. Transfer money to your family and friends regardless of their current location. It is simple and cost-efficient! Receive money transfers, salary, stipend or pension from anywhere in the world to your account with a unique IBAN. Get a Mastercard® for daily in-store and online shopping, hotel bookings, airplane tickets and souvenirs purchase while abroad. Enjoy the freedom of carrying around just one card.For your business needs. Multiple IBANs from several EU countries, international SWIFT and SEPA transfers, Mastercard® for expenses and payroll programs, multi-currency exchange, electronic invoicing and merchant accounts. Time to make your business truly international and flexible for your clients and suppliers.With Satchel you can open an account remotely. Moreover, the whole process is much easier and faster than in a regular bank. You can finally forget about spending weeks to schedule an appointment or hours on the phone to get a response to a simple question. Join Satchel to satisfy your modern financial needs.

All of your finances are always under control with Satchel mobile app.

With us you can:
- Open an account with a unique IBAN;
- Hold and manage your funds in multiple currencies;
- Exchange seven currencies at affordable rates;
- Send and receive international bank wire transfers;
- Spend money around the world using your prepaid card;
- Issue mass payments to bank accounts.

Our mobile app features:
- Round-the-clock access to your account from your device;
- Real-time review of account activity and balance;
- Transaction history to keep track of your spendings;
- New Feature for Recurring Transactions;-Money transfers worldwide;
- Card top-up;
- Simplified sign in procedure with your password and biometric authentication.

With Satchel, performing a wide range of existing transnational operations becomes as simple as never before.

